{"id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-quotient-algebra.md","title":"Quotient Algebra","display":"df-quotient-algebra — Quotient Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-quotient-algebra","aliases":["93-df-quotient-algebra"],"display":"df-quotient-algebra — Quotient Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-quotient-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-quotient-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotient-algebra — Quotient Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a similarity type and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> is a congruence.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassTuple}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuotOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{QuotOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}\\)</span> are the explicit congruence-class, class-tuple, quotient-carrier, quotient-operation, operation-family, and indexed quotient-family constructors defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\\)</span> are the type-indexed quotient algebra and its canonical projection, both defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\coloneqq\n\\{b\\in|\\mathfrak A|:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\theta\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\coloneqq\n\\{b\\in|\\mathfrak A|:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\theta\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(\\bar a(i);\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(\\bar a(i);\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta):a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta):a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a);\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\n\\Bigr\\rangle:\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a);\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\n\\Bigr\\rangle:\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QuotOpFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,\\tau)\\right\\rangle:\nf\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QuotOpFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,\\tau)\\right\\rangle:\nf\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta),\n\\operatorname{QuotOpFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta),\n\\operatorname{QuotOpFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\boldsymbol\\theta;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\boldsymbol\\theta(i);\\tau)\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\boldsymbol\\theta;I,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\boldsymbol\\theta(i);\\tau)\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\rangle:\na\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\rangle:\na\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl(\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,\\tau):\n\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\to\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{QuotOpFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau):\\pi_1(\\tau)\\to V\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau))\n\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau):\n|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)|\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl(\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\theta,\\tau):\n\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta)^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\n\\to\\operatorname{QuotCar}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{QuotOpFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau):\\pi_1(\\tau)\\to V\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau))\n\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau):\n|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\theta;\\tau)|\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The compatibility clause in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a> proves that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{QuotOp}_{93}\\)</span> is independent of representatives. Congruence classes, class tuples, the quotient carrier, every quotient operation, both family graphs, and the canonical projection are all explicit sets. The name <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\)</span> is distinct from the equational-class predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The compatibility clause in 